cabal-version: 3.18
name: libtmux-haskell
version: 0.1.0.0
synopsis: Haskell tmux client library with detached snapshots
description:
  Capture a validated tmux graph in IO, then inspect immutable sessions,
  physical windows, panes and contextual links with ordinary Haskell values.
  Scoped handles retain cleanup ownership after cancellation and failure.
  Typed queries inspect captured values with explicit cardinality and ordering.
  Rename sessions and physical windows and set pane titles with checked
  references, bounded deadlines and correlated recovery. Creation, pane input
  and events remain under development.
license: MIT
license-file: LICENSE
author: libtmux contributors
maintainer: https://github.com/libtmux/libtmux-haskell/issues
category: System
homepage: https://github.com/libtmux/libtmux-haskell
